# This site has no environment configuration.
#
# It is a static front-end: pricing and trial signup call the public
# ZS-ERP endpoints at https://app.zsystemai.com directly, and country
# detection calls https://get.geojs.io. There are no API keys, secrets,
# or .env values to set — locally or in production. (An earlier
# AI Studio template shipped a GEMINI_API_KEY placeholder here; it was
# never read by any code in this repository and has been removed.)
